      "content": "ugh i just accidentally got some of that heavy duty floor cleaner in my eye while i was cleaning. it feels really scratchy and my eye is all red. i have some leftover opcon antibiotic eye drops from a few months ago from when i had that eye infection, do u think i should put some of that in now just so i don't get an infection from the soap?",
